items.PortalKey_Hircine.name = Hircine's Hunting Grounds - Portal Key
portals.hircine = Hircine's Hunting Grounds
portals.hircine.description = Hunting grounds is a savage, primordial Daedric realm of Oblivion. It features endless dense forests and vast grasslands where predators and prey exist in an eternal, violent cycle of death, rebirth, and spectacular hunts.
portals.hircine.tip1 = Werewolfs are great source of Voidhearts!
portals.hircine.tip2 = Top of the obelisks is almost always ended with some valuable gems, also there are some hidden chests inside of them!

items.PortalKey_Coldest_Reaches.name = Coldest Reaches of Oblivion - Portal Key
portals.coldest_reaches = Coldest Reaches of Oblivion
portals.coldest_reaches.description = A frozen domain of Oblivion ruled by Ice Atronachs and other frost-loving Daedra. Rumors claim that ships sailing too near Mundus Northern Pole are sometimes seized by raging whirlwinds and dragged into this eternal cold.
portals.coldest_reaches.tip1 = Take some jacket!
portals.coldest_reaches.tip2 = Great source of diamonds and sapphires!

